tps://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/downloads","issues_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues{/number}","pulls_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/pulls{/number}","milestones_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/milestones{/number}","notifications_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/notifications{?since,all,participating}","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/labels{/name}","releases_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/releases{/id}","deployments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/deployments","created_at":"2017-10-05T21:56:00Z","updated_at":"2025-12-13T01:01:53Z","pushed_at":"2025-12-13T05:03:31Z","git_url":"git://github.com/yugabyte/yugabyte-db.git","ssh_url":"git@github.com:yugabyte/yugabyte-db.git","clone_url":"https://github.com/yugabyte/yugabyte-db.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/yugabyte/yugabyte-db","homepage":"https://www.yugabyte.com","size":908218,"stargazers_count":9958,"watchers_count":9958,"language":"C","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":true,"has_wiki":true,"has_pages":false,"has_discussions":false,"forks_count":1201,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":7608,"license":{"key":"other","name":"Other","spdx_id":"NOASSERTION","url":null,"node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTA="},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"topics":["cloud-native","cpp","database","distributed-database","distributed-sql","distributed-sql-database","high-performance","kubernetes","multi-cloud","multi-region","scale-out","sql"],"visibility":"public","forks":1201,"open_issues":7608,"watchers":9958,"default_branch":"master","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"body":"Jira Link: [DB-17652](https://yugabyte.atlassian.net/browse/DB-17652)\n### Description\n\nVersion: Seen in master/ 2024.2.5.0-b14\n\n(Didn't see it in 2024.2.5.0-b8) so mostly a regression in between 2024.2.5.0-b8 to 2024.2.5.0-b14\n\nLogs: Added in Jira comments\n\nA SIGSEGV was observed in the Postgres process while running cross db ddls+ dml workload involving colocated and non-colocated databases. The crash occurred inside __longjmp as per the LLDB backtrace.\n\n<img width=\"1691\" height=\"927\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1ca51a93-9871-4757-b69b-61d31c16d6cc\" />\n\n\n<img width=\"1728\" height=\"437\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5775c95f-31a7-453d-9b84-4f9dff3cb7f9\" />\n\n```\nTest Description:\n        1. Create a cluster with required g-flags\n        2. Start the cross DB DDL workload which will execute DDLs and DMLs across databases concurrently (50 colocated\n           database and 100 non-colocated database), run this for 20-30 mins\n        3. Create a PITR schedule on 20 random database\n        4. Start a while loop and run it for 120 mins\n          a. Note down time fr PITR(0) \n          b. Create a backup of 1 random database\n          c. Start the cross DB DDL workload and stop it after 10 mins\n          d. Note down the time for PITR(1)\n          e. Start the cross DB DDL workload and run it for 10 mins\n          f. Execute PITR on all 10 databases at random times(Between 1-9 sec ago).\n          g. Restore to PITR(1)\n          h. Validate data\n          i. Restore to PITR(0) with a probability of 0.6 and validate data\n          j. Delete the PITR schedule for the backup db \n          k. Drop the database \n          l. Restore the backup\n          m. Create the snapshot schedule for this new DB\n        \"\"\"\n```\n\n```\n(lldb) target create \"/home/yugabyte/yb-software/yugabyte-2024.2.5.0-b14-centos-x86_64/postgres/bin/postgres\" --core \"/home/yugabyte/cores/core_663468_1752572122_!home!yugabyte!yb-software!yugabyte-2024.2.5.0-b14-centos-x86_64!postgres!bin!postgres\"\nCore file '/home/yugabyte/cores/core_663468_1752572122_!home!yugabyte!yb-software!yugabyte-2024.2.5.0-b14-centos-x86_64!postgres!bin!postgres' (x86_64) was loaded.\n(lldb) bt all\n* thread #1, name = 'postgres', stop reason = signal SIGSEGV\n  * frame #0: 0x00007f426883e9ee libc.so.6`__longjmp + 142\n  thread #2, stop reason = signal 0\n    frame #0: 0x00007f426888722a libc.so.6`__futex_abstimed_wait_common + 202\n    frame #1: 0x00007f4268889782 libc.so.6`pthread_cond_wait@@GLIBC_2.3.2 + 306\n    frame #2: 0x00007f426529fb77 libyrpc.so`boost::asio::detail::scheduler::run(boost::system::error_code&) [inlined] void boost::asio::detail::posix_event::wait<boost::asio::detail::conditionally_enabled_mutex::scoped_lock>(this=0x000050b17fe0f370, lock=0x00007f4259754fb8) at posix_event.hpp:119:7\n    frame #3: 0x00007f426529fb5a libyrpc.so`boost::asio::detail::scheduler::run(boost::system::error_code&) [inlined] boost::asio::detail::conditionally_enabled_event::wait(this=0x000050b17fe0f368, lock=0x00007f4259754fb8) at conditionally_enabled_event.hpp:97:14\n    frame #4: 0x00007f426529fb50 libyrpc.so`boost::asio::detail::scheduler::run(boost::system::error_code&) [inlined] boost::asio::detail::scheduler::do_run_one(this=0x000050b17fe0f300, lock=0x00007f4259754fb8, this_thread=0x00007f4259754ee0, ec=0x00007f4259755010) at scheduler.ipp:501:21\n    frame #5: 0x00007f426529fa51 libyrpc.so`boost::asio::detail::scheduler::run(this=0x000050b17fe0f300, ec=0x00007f4259755010) at scheduler.ipp:210:10\n    frame #6: 0x00007f426529f2a7 libyrpc.so`yb::rpc::IoThreadPool::Impl::Execute() [inlined] boost::asio::io_context::run(this=<unavailable>, ec=0x00007f4259755010) at io_context.ipp:71:16\n    frame #7: 0x00007f426529f29a libyrpc.so`yb::rpc::IoThreadPool::Impl::Execute(this=<unavailable>) at io_thread_pool.cc:76:17\n    frame #8: 0x00007f4264cab7f0 libyb_util.so`yb::Thread::SuperviseThread(void*) [inlined] std::__1::__function::__value_func<void ()>::operator(this=0x000050b17fe14a80)[abi:ue170006](